tion-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"ae08a98\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-dd418e0\" data-id=\"dd418e0\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a374d3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2a374d3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c3ce61 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4c3ce61\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ea4e691 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ea4e691\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b108a08 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b108a08\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The School of Graduate Studies (SGS) at CamTech University has a philosophy deeply rooted in a proactive response to the dynamic challenges facing our world today, particularly in the context of Industry Revolution 4.0 and its environmental and social implications. Positioned strategically, SGS aims to address these complexities through its overarching theme: &#8220;Science, Technology, and Sustainability (STS).&#8221; At the heart of SGS&#8217;s philosophy are three foundational pillars: academic excellence, impacts on career, and community engagement. These pillars serve as guiding principles shaping the core curriculum across all majors, embodying a holistic approach to graduate education. The vision of becoming a leading graduate school in STS is intricately woven into the design of the core curriculum, aligning educational objectives with the broader goal of producing skilled graduates capable of addressing complex issues in sustainable development. The goals and objectives further solidify this philosophy, emphasizing the establishment of SGS as a center for interdisciplinary collaboration and engagement. By offering high-quality master&#8217;s and doctoral programs, fostering diverse perspectives, and prioritizing critical thinking and problem-solving skills, the core curriculum reflects a commitment to nurturing well-rounded individuals poised to make significant contributions in their respective fields.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0efa2d5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0efa2d5\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d23c65c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d23c65c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35127c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"35127c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bda7aa5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bda7aa5\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ada72ac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"