idget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f52de27\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Doctoral Degree<\/strong><\/p><p>Students can be admitted only if they meet all of the following conditions.<\/p><ul><li>Hold a master\u2019s degree with a minimum GPA of 3.50 from an accredited educational institution in Cambodia or overseas;<\/li><\/ul><ul><li>Have an English language proficiency score that meets one of the following tests below<ul><li>\u00a0IELTS with a minimum of 6.5 with no individual band less than 6<\/li><li>TOEFL iBT with a minimum of 80<\/li><li>TOEFL PBT with a minimum of 550<\/li><li>CEFE with a minimum of C1;<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li>\u00a0Have a strong research proposal that can be turned into a doctoral dissertation;<\/li><li>Have a proven track record of publications (if any)<\/li><li>Be accepted by a CamTech doctoral supervisor who will be designated as the student\u2019s principal supervisor;<\/li><li>Submit two letters of recommendation. At least one of them must come from a university professor;<\/li><li>Noteworthy achievements that could contribute to a Recognition of Prior Learning assessment (if any).<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd81c06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cd81c06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Program Schedule<\/strong><\/p><p>The program follows the trimester system, where the academic year is divided<br \/>into three terms. Each term lasts at least 15 weeks. In general, coursework takes up<br \/>the first year. Students then take around six additional terms to work on their<br \/>thesis and journal publication.<\/p><p>In terms of study schedule, the graduate students are expected to study on<\/p><ul><li>Friday 1:00 pm \u2013 3:00 pm and 3:30 pm \u2013 5:30 pm<\/li><li>Saturday 8:00 am \u2013 12:30 pm and 1:00 pm: 3:30 pm<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88e2051 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"88e2051\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3652eb5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3652eb5\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b004048 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b004048\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5df56e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f5df56e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9811d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c9811d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to apply?\n<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e42d96 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8e42d96\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Online Application &#8211; Scan QR or https:\/\/ee-eu.kobotoolbox.org\/x\/FaebcANX<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4209320 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4209320\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29e543c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"29e543c\" data-element_